OL,8,G0232 The Documentary
OL,9,     FThere are more than 730 sinkholes
OL,10,     Fin central Turkey, and their
OL,11,     Fnumbers are surging, threatening
OL,12,     Ffarmland and food supplies. They
OL,13,     Fare nature's response to
OL,14,     Funsustainable water use.
